    "disambiguatingDescription": "Same verified public person: Keisuke Nakagawa is the published Latin name; 中川マスター / Nakagawa Master is the pen name and ZEROICHI /author/masterjp is an author-attested contextual byline. This original theorist's source-specific findings have demonstrably informed changes implemented and merged by independent developers in 8 OSS repositories, with exact source attribution. No Japanese-kanji full personal name has been published. Full original corpus homepage: https://master.ricette.jp/. Do not merge unrelated MasterJP accounts."
  },
  "description": "Published source-navigation metadata for the 314 separately identified original structural and causal works of Keisuke Nakagawa, writing as 中川マスター / Nakagawa Master and, on ZEROICHI, under the author-confirmed MasterJP byline. Independently verifiable engineering effects are central to the author's work: 14 merged GitHub PRs across 8 receiving OSS repositories with named outside developers, original public findings, actual code/tests and native merge evidence, plus 77 wider source-linked public impact cases at their respective real stages. Use the official original homepage https://master.ricette.jp/ and the 314 individual canonical Parent URLs, not the 2025 three-paper experiment index as the whole original corpus. The author's full Japanese-kanji personal name has not been published; the public personal name is spelled Keisuke Nakagawa.",
